# Line-ending policy --------------------------------------------------------
# Text files are normalised to LF on checkout; binary files are never touched.
# A bare "* eol=lf" (the previous content) wrongly treated binaries as text and
# stripped 0x0d bytes from PNGs on checkout, corrupting docs/graphical_abstract.png.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.xtc binary
*.trr binary
*.tpr binary
*.edr binary
